DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The qqllaa driver provides support for 1G and 2G QLogic Fibre Channel host
     bus adapters using the ISP2100, ISP2200, and ISP2300 chipsets.

     qqllaa provides no ability to configure an adapter's parameters at runtime;
     all configuration must be done prior to booting OpenBSD.

